Fossify mmslib fork
===================

This repository is a fork of the Fossify mmslib library, which itself derives
from android-smsmms by Jacob Klinker and from the Android Open Source Project
(AOSP) `packages/apps/Mms` MMS stack. All of it is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Upstream projects and pinned fork commit
----------------------------------------

- FossifyOrg/android-smsmms (fork: FossifyOrg/mmslib), Apache-2.0.
  This checkout is based on commit ebfbb30d616631eca86f9cd257f627bdb636c1c2.
- klinker/android-smsmms by Jacob Klinker, Apache-2.0.
- AOSP `packages/apps/Mms` and the `com.google.android.mms` /
  `com.android.mms` packages, Apache-2.0, Copyright (C) 2007-2014 The Android
  Open Source Project.

Bundled third-party dependencies (declared in library/build.gradle.kts)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

- com.klinkerapps:logger 1.0.3, Apache-2.0
- com.squareup.okhttp:okhttp 2.5.0, Apache-2.0
- com.squareup.okhttp:okhttp-urlconnection 2.5.0, Apache-2.0

The vendored copies under `library/src/main/java/org/w3c/dom` and
`library/src/main/java/org/xmlpull` originate from the AOSP MMS code base and
keep their original Apache-2.0 headers.
